    <string name="battery_guide">1. Open Battery settings and set StepTrack Pro to \"Don\'t optimize\" (unrestricted).\n2. Vivo / iQOO: also allow Autostart and \"High background power consumption\" for StepTrack Pro. Menu names differ between versions.\n3. Keep the app locked in the recent apps list, and do not swipe it away if your phone offers a lock option.\n4. Check the notification: if it disappears, tracking has stopped. Open the app to restart it.</string>
